{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2024-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1729036800, "end_date": 1729727999, "month_true_total": 2329, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:06:59 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "177612854", "author": {"steamid": "76561199279288908", "personaname": "DX10", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199279288908/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1495, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1158, "last_played": 1734398722, "avatar": "04a7f3dd0a2202869ead43dee011baa669ee00cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game overall. it takes a bit of grinding to get certain things but the actual gameplay is good and there is a lot of content. for the people saying the new player experience is bad its really not its actually quite fun imo.", "timestamp_created": 1729725444, "timestamp_updated": 1729725444, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177611320", "author": {"steamid": "76561199468645255", "personaname": "Adastra_Royal", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199468645255/", "num_games_owned": 76, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 22370, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3282, "playtime_at_review": 2260, "last_played": 1789437253, "avatar": "c293c28982636383df5d1a086ad95c20011158ac"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game", "timestamp_created": 1729723230, "timestamp_updated": 1729723230, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177610560", "author": {"steamid": "76561199436226842", "personaname": "Doctor Scar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199436226842/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 236219, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3460, "playtime_at_review": 58986, "last_played": 1789376241, "avatar": "9822bd54e09e05a4410d38f46df2041f49f639f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "I literally cannot describe how much this game has to offer, from roguelikes to masively power crept builds, to amazing bossfights, this game has alot of what modern games today lack, moreover it has a development team that genuenly cares for their playerbase instead of seeing them as just the next money bag, truly 10/10 does not even begin to describe how good the game is.", "timestamp_created": 1729722059, "timestamp_updated": 1729722059, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177609140", "author": {"steamid": "76561198094396116", "personaname": "Shylumi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/shylumi/", "num_games_owned": 196, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 303284, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2682, "playtime_at_review": 271106, "last_played": 1789322977, "avatar": "42df3d72895a541b0a8aa7716163ab7926eef8bd"}, "language": "english", "review": "I liked:\nThis game is a loadout Lego builder where you farm for more and more Legos to play with. You can farm all the weapons in the game in time.\n\nThis game is ideal for people who want to calmly blast through the galaxy, chill with friends, and not be stessed about gameplay.\n\nI disliked:\nThere are barely any activities that allow you to skillfully practice. \"Skill\" in this game is 90% just having the right loadout. This makes the endgame feel unfulfilling, similar to weilding Zenith in Terraria.\n\nThis game is on easy mode. The devs continue to use the damage = difficulty formula (which you win with the right loadout) which makes the gameplay lack diversity.\n\nThey clearly know that and will continue with the same formula because it works. It has become the identity of this game.\n\nI've come to the realization that 80% of the gameplay is just Exterminate with extra steps. The bosses are cool but not difficult at all. Minmaxing is awesome at first, but gets old.", "timestamp_created": 1729720044, "timestamp_updated": 1729720044, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177607410", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040840273", "personaname": "Sarge", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Rekkonin/", "num_games_owned": 1289, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 164767, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 305, "playtime_at_review": 65936, "last_played": 1788910851, "avatar": "7a27e91a9533544e93c5ddc9edb391960f16d6b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've been playing this for 8 years now. I've done everything, and I'm still playing. It's good.", "timestamp_created": 1729717582, "timestamp_updated": 1729717582, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50432586669921875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactio